                "const": "Invariant: concurrent requests admit exactly limit operations and all later operations receive rate_limited with Retry-After; stable outcomes: success=pass/none, failure=failed/internal, outage=unavailable/unavailable, concurrency=pass/conflict; required artifact fields: admitted_count, rejected_count, retry_after_seconds, postgres_counter, valkey_counter"
